  {
   "id": 666985,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "If the <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">binary_search()</code> function is called with <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">low = 4</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">high = 7</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">mid</code> computes to _____.",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1329938,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">5</code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">mid = (4 + 7) // 2 = 11 // 2 = 5</code>. The operator // is used for floor division."
    },
    {
     "id": 1329939,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">6</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "mid = (4 + 7) // 2 = 11 // 2 = 5. The operator // is used for floor division."
    },
    {
     "id": 1329940,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">11</code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "4 + 7 = 11, but the low and high indices are not added together to compute mid. mid = (low + high) // 2"
    }
   ],
